r\n\r\nThis PR changes profiler marks from a format like `\"--schedule-render-1\"` to `\"--schedule-render-1-Sync\"` which will enable the profiler itself to show more meaningful labels for updates and render work.\r\n\r\nThere are a couple of downsides to this proposed change:\r\n1. It requires maintaining a map of bitmask range to string/label in `ReactFiberLane`. Hopefully not a huge burden but something we would need to remember to keep in sync.\r\n2. It increases the size of User Timing data logged by the profiler during render. (I don't think there's a way around this since there's no initialization event where we can log a standalone mapping). Perhaps we could log a mapping with each commit or something but that doesn't seem like an obvious improvement.\r\n\r\nThis PR also refactors and cleans up a few of the scheduling profiler tests to rely less on hard-coded data and formats and verify the current source code behavior.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThis PR also resolves #20767. I just fixed it while I was in there testing.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react/issues/20808/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react/issues/20808/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":4365864697,"node_id":"MDE1OlJlZmVyZW5jZWRFdmVudDQzNjU4NjQ2OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react/issues/events/4365864697","actor":{"login":"bvaughn","id":29597,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NTk3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29597?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bvaughn","html_url":"https://github.com/bvaughn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bvaughn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bvaughn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bvaughn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://